#. 朝日奈さんが疑ってるのって、
#. その３人が<CLT 3>大神さんに呼び出されてた<CLT>からだよね？
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Another reason you suspect them is because <CLT 3>Sakura\n"
"wanted to meet with them<CLT>, right?"
msgstr ""

#. そうだよ…しかも<CLT 3>事件の直前<CLT>にね…！
msgctxt "0002 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Yeah! And that was <CLT 3>right before she died<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. だから間違いないよ！　そいつらの中に、
#. さくらちゃんを殺した犯人がいるんだッ！
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"So there's no doubt about it! One of those three\n"
"killed her!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんが言ってるように、
#. その３人が怪しいのは間違いない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't disagree with Hina. There's good reason to\n"
"suspect all three of them...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>じゃあ…その中に犯人がいるのか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Then does that mean...one of them did it?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
